<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Argos to rebuy shares.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Argos to rebuy shares.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican bottler Sistema Argos SA (Argos) said through the Mexican stock exchange on Wednesday that it will temporarily buy back five million pesos worth of its own shares.</p>
<p>Argos said it would buy the shares at the prevailing market value until the end of January. But the report did not indicate for how long Argos plans to hold on to the shares.</p>
<p>The Value brokerage house will handle the transations.</p>
<p>((--Karina Balderas, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9562))</p>
